18423	2026-01-05 10:18:05.011034+00	ff026221-82ae-5636-8279-a322225a968e	SG		<thought>**Another Day, Another Scam (and Some Gardening!)**\n\nAlright, Simon, you're the best! Now, about that squid... gotta keep an eye on that water bowl, gotta out-cute little Gill! Ugh, *work*. But hey, for the future watermelon empire, even this lazy cat had to get its paws dirty. 17 and 19 are mine! Time for a nap, dreaming of squid-flavored watermelon. Nighty night!\n\n\n</thought>2月19日 \n\nSimon~ 鱿鱼快给呱呱！为了这口吃的，我盯着水面眼睛都酸啦，主人最疼我了喵！\n\n虽然最讨厌干活，但为了西瓜帝国，本喵还是勉强刨了坑。\n\n17和19号地已被我占领，嘿嘿！累死喵了，梦里一定要有吃不完的鱿鱼		7008.03	818	96	0	/app/output/ff026221-82ae-5636-8279-a322225a968e/20260105_101805_011-dd61c057.jsonl	0	chat	eae96b0e-15fa-49fa-8bde-fcf5a9f7407e	dev	\N
